{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24319","headline":"酬郑二司录与李六郎中寒食日相过同宴见赠 · 白居易","name":"酬郑二司录与李六郎中寒食日相过同宴见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶因冷节会嘉宾，况是平生心所亲。\n迎接须衿疏傅老，祗供莫笑阮家贫。\n杯盘狼籍宜侵夜，风景阑珊欲过春。\n相对喜欢还怅望，同年只有此三人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}